><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>15</x><y>260</y></point><point><x>27</x><y>371</y></point><point><x>112</x><y>373</y></point><point><x>100</x><y>260</y></point><point><x>15</x><y>260</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>8</labeltarget><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Chinches&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="73" y="252" w="70" h="17"/></label><label labelid="7" action="popUp" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="1" locklabel="0"><pos x="193" y="269"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Mantis&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea><point><x>158</x><y>121</y></point><point><x>168</x><y>140</y></point><point><x>176</x><y>167</y></point><point><x>157</x><y>216</y></point><point><x>174</x><y>276</y></point><point><x>201</x><y>286</y></point><point><x>241</x><y>285</y></point><point><x>253</x><y>264</y></point><point><x>297</x><y>188</y></point><point><x>301</x><y>155</y></point><point><x>273</x><y>117</y></point><point><x>218</x><y>111</y></point><point><x>183</x><y>104</y></point><point><x>158</x><y>121</y></point></hotarea><labeltarget>9</labeltarget><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Mantis&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="189" y="270" w="53" h="17"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>418</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Los insectos&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="3" sequence="9"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los escarabajos son los insectos más numerosos. Tienen cuatro alas. Las dos alas anteriores son duras, y reciben el nombre de élitros. Las dos alas posteriores son membranosas y son las que utilizan para volar. Cuando están parados, esconden las alas membranosas debajo de los élitros. Muchos escarabajos tienen colores oscuros, pero otros presentan colores muy llamativos. La popular mariquita es un escarabajo.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Escarabajos&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126d96_slide2.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="339" y="116"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="335" y="117" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="172" y="28"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ojo compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ojo compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="168" y="29" w="103" h="16"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="37" y="23"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ala anterior o élitro&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ala anterior&lt;br&gt;o élitro&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="27" y="24" w="91" h="31"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="10" y="92"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ala posterior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ala&lt;br&gt;posterior&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="0" y="93" w="66" h="31"/></label><label labelid="5" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="346" y="233"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pata media&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Patas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="336" y="234" w="43" h="16"/></label><label labelid="7" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="340" y="148"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Cabeza&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Cabeza&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="336" y="149" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="8" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="106" y="299"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Abdomen&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Abdomen&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="102" y="300" w="68" h="16"/></label><label labelid="9" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="212" y="299"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Tórax&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>3</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tórax&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="208" y="300" w="45" h="16"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>332</imageheight><imagewidth>393</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Escarabajos&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="2" sequence="9"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;En los saltamontes es fácil observar la división del cuerpo en 3 partes: cabeza, tórax y abdomen. Seguramente lo que más conoces de los saltamontes es su gran habilidad para saltar. Como puedes ver en el dibujo, los saltamontes tienen las patas posteriores muy fuertes y robustas, lo que les permite dar grandes saltos. Al igual que sus parientes los grillos, muchos saltamontes son capaces de producir sonidos frotando sus alas y algunos también frotando sus patas. Los saltamontes se alimentan de plantas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Saltamontes&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126d96_slide1.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="45" y="36"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="41" y="37" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="94" y="45"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ojo compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ojo&lt;br&gt;compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="90" y="46" w="77" h="31"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="243" y="38"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ala anterior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>2</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid