/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pata anterior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pata&lt;br&gt;anterior&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="14" y="271" w="60" h="31"/></label><label labelid="10" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="110" y="270"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-32</y></point></points><origin><x>106</x><y>287</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pata media&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pata&lt;br&gt;media&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="106" y="271" w="47" h="31"/></label><label labelid="11" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="184" y="269"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-44</y></point></points><origin><x>180</x><y>286</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Pata posterior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>5</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pata&lt;br&gt;posterior&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="180" y="270" w="66" h="31"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>332</imageheight><imagewidth>393</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Libélulas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="6" sequence="9"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las mariposas son fáciles de reconocer porque tienen alas cubiertas de escamas con colores muy bonitos y llamativos. Después de los escarabajos, las mariposas son los insectos más numerosos. Tienen una boca que termina en una especie de tubito, llamado probóscide, que utilizan para chupar el néctar de las flores. Poseen 2 antenas largas y dos ojos grandes bien desarrollados.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Mariposas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126d96_slide4.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="25" y="145"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="21" y="146" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="47" y="53"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ojo compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid