ge/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Tórax&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="121" y="301" w="45" h="16"/></label><label labelid="10" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="172" y="300"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Abdomen&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Abdomen&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="168" y="301" w="68" h="16"/></label><label labelid="11" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="11" y="228"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Probóscide&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>6</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Probóscide&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="7" y="229" w="78" h="16"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>332</imageheight><imagewidth>393</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Mariposas&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="7" sequence="9"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las moscas y mosquitos sólo poseen dos alas membranosas y no cuatro como la mayoría de los insectos. Tienen en las patas una especie de ventosas, llamadas pulvillos, que les permiten agarrarse a las superficies lisas. Seguramente has visto como las moscas caminan por las paredes y ¡hasta por las ventanas o el techo!&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Moscas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126d96_slide6.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="21" y="158"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>7</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="17" y="159" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="66" y="46"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ojo compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>7</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ojo&lt;br&gt;compuesto&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="56" y="47" w="77" h="31"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="337" y="159"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ala &lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>7</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ala &lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="333" y="160" w="33" h="16"/></label><label lab