oint></points><origin><x>308</x><y>151</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Escutelo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>8</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Escutelo&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="308" y="143" w="62" h="16"/></label><label labelid="7" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="314" y="207"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Patas&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>8</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Patas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="310" y="208" w="43" h="16"/></label><label labelid="8" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="314" y="166"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-79</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>310</x><y>183</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Ala anterior&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>8</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ala&lt;br&gt;anterior&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="310" y="167" w="60" h="31"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>332</imageheight><imagewidth>393</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Chinches&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="9" sequence="9"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Las mantis son insectos delgados y alargados. La cabeza tiene forma triangular y presenta dos grandes ojos. Las mantis son depredadoras y se alimentan de una gran variedad de insectos. Permanecen quietas esperando a que se acerque una presa y cuando ésta se sitúa cerca se lanzan hacia ella y la agarran con sus patas anteriores, que son muy fuertes y están provistas de espinas.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Mantis&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00126d96_slide8.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="16" y="26"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>51</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>66</x><y>35</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget>9</labeltarget><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Antena&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="12" y="27" w="54" h="16"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="314" y="68"/><leaderline forecolorid="3" bgcolorid="2"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-128</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>310</x><y>85</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;ht